!.env.example
# NOTE: docs/ is intentionally NOT ignored — mcp/Dockerfile bakes docs/**/*.md
# into the image for the RAG protocol-knowledge seed (mcp/src/seed.rs). The
# `*.md` pattern below only matches root-level markdown (README, CHANGELOG),
# not docs/ subtree files, so the seed corpus is preserved.
*.md
